写 Python 脚本时：\n\n- 测试相关 → `doc/testcode/python/tests/test_<name>.py`\n- API 测试 → `doc/testcode/python/api/test_<name>.py`\n- 提示词相关 → `doc/testcode/python/prompts/<name>.py`\n- 工具脚本 → `doc/testcode/python/utils/<name>.py`\n\n运行脚本时使用项目自带 Python：\n\n```bash\n\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/localLanguage/python/python.exe\" doc/testcode/python/<path>/script.py\n```\n\n如果自带 Python 不可用，回退到系统 `python`。\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":19,"oldLines":10,"newStart":19,"newLines":8,"lines":[" "," ```"," doc/testcode/python/","-├── tests/          # 功能测试脚本","-├── prompts/        # 提示词测试与对比"," ├── api/            # API 自动化测试","-└── utils/          # 工具脚本","+└── other/          # 其他脚本（测试、提示词、工具等）"," ```"," "," ## 规则"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_use_id":"call_c5fc42060efa4e7fb10cd8af","duration_ms":25}
