y`，工具脚本命名：`<name>.py`\n\n## 操作指引\n\n当用户要求编写 Python 脚本时：\n\n- 测试相关 → `doc/testcode/python/tests/test_<name>.py`\n- API 测试 → `doc/testcode/python/api/test_<name>.py`\n- 提示词相关 → `doc/testcode/python/prompts/<name>.py`\n- 工具脚本 → `doc/testcode/python/utils/<name>.py`\n\n运行脚本时使用项目自带 Python：\n\n```bash\n\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/localLanguage/python/python.exe\" doc/testcode/python/<path>/script.py\n```\n\n如果自带 Python 不可用，回退到系统 `python`。\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":36,"oldLines":10,"newStart":36,"newLines":8,"lines":[" "," 当用户要求编写 Python 脚本时："," ","-- 测试相关 → `doc/testcode/python/tests/test_<name>.py`"," - API 测试 → `doc/testcode/python/api/test_<name>.py`","-- 提示词相关 → `doc/testcode/python/prompts/<name>.py`","-- 工具脚本 → `doc/testcode/python/utils/<name>.py`","+- 其他脚本 → `doc/testcode/python/other/<name>.py`"," "," 运行脚本时使用项目自带 Python："," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_use_id":"call_0aceccb1455d47bdb25fc32c","duration_ms":20}
