/python.exe\" doc/testcode/python/<path>/script.py\n```\n\n如果自带 Python 不可用，回退到系统 `python`。\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":23,"oldLines":6,"newStart":23,"newLines":12,"lines":[" └── other/          # 其他脚本（测试、提示词、工具等）"," ```"," ","+## 当前信息","+","+- **日期**：$(date +%Y-%m-%d)","+- **目录**：`$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/doc/testcode/python/`","+- **Python**：`$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/localLanguage/python/python.exe`","+"," ## 规则"," "," 1. 所有脚本放到对应子目录，不在根目录散落文件"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_use_id":"call_7858f75d612849c9b9fbc57a","duration_ms":20}
