: \"\"\n      hooks:\n        - type: command\n          command: \"bash \\\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/skills/testcode-python/scripts/on_load.sh\\\"\"\n---\n\n# Testcode Python Skill\n\n在 `$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/doc/testcode/python/` 下编写和管理 Python 脚本。\n\n## 目录规范\n\n```\ndoc/testcode/python/\n├── api/            # API 自动化测试\n└── other/          # 其他脚本（测试、提示词、工具等）\n```\n\n## 规则\n\n1. 所有脚本放到对应子目录，不在根目录散落文件\n2. 每个脚本文件开头写明用途（一行注释）\n3. API 测试脚本使用 `requests` 库，基础配置从环境变量或 `.env` 读取\n4. 优先用标准库，需要第三方库时先在脚本顶部 `import` 前用注释标注依赖\n5. 测试脚本命名：`test_<name>.py`，工具脚本命名：`<name>.py`\n\n## 操作指引\n\n- API 测试 → `doc/testcode/python/api/test_<name>.py`\n- 其他脚本 → `doc/testcode/python/other/<name>.py`\n\n运行脚本时使用项目自带 Python：\n\n```bash\n\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/localLanguage/python/python.exe\" doc/testcode/python/<path>/script.py\n```\n\n如果自带 Python 不可用，回退到系统 `python`。\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1,"newLines":6,"lines":[" ---"," name: testcode-python","-description: 在 doc/testcode/python 目录下编写和管理 Python 测试脚本、API 自动化测试、提示词测试及工具脚本","+description: 在 doc/testcode/python 目录下编写和管理 Python 测试脚本、API 自动化测试及其他脚本"," user-invocable: true"," allowed-tools:","   - Bash"]},{"oldStart":9,"oldLines":6,"newStart":9,"newLines":12,"lines":["   - Edit","   - Glob","   - Grep","+hooks:","+  InstructionsLoaded:","+    - matcher: \"\"","+      hooks:","+        - type: command","+          command: \"bash \\\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/skills/testcode-python/scripts/on_load.sh\\\"\""," ---"," "," # Testcode Python Skill"]},{"oldStart":23,"oldLines":25,"newStart":29,"newLines":16,"lines":[" └── other/          # 其他脚本（测试、提示词、工具等）"," ```"," ","-## 当前信息","-","-- **日期**：$(date +%Y-%m-%d)","-- **目录**：`$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/doc/testcode/python/`","-- **Python**：`$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/localLanguage/python/python.exe`","-"," ## 规则"," "," 1. 所有脚本放到对应子目录，不在根目录散落文件"," 2. 每个脚本文件开头写明用途（一行注释）"," 3. API 测试脚本使用 `requests` 库，基础配置从环境变量或 `.env` 读取","-4. 提示词测试脚本使用项目自带 Python：`$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.c